    <string name="profile_intro_title">Why this matters</string>
    <string name="profile_intro_body">Your profile sets your maximum heart rate, which sets your heart-rate zones and the Strain score. A maximum you enter yourself always wins. Without one, Apex estimates it from your age as 208 minus 0.7 times your age, and uses the higher of that and the highest heart rate your band has recorded. All fields are optional, and nothing leaves this phone. See How Apex works for the full formulas.</string>

